{"id":164,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","Y","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"When it needs to think, it rotates its head 180 degrees to sharpen its intellectual power."},{"games":["Sword","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"Its eyes are specially developed to enable it to see clearly even in murky darkness and minimal light."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"When it turns its head entirely upside down, you know it’s troubled by something. If you don’t leave it be, it will peck you."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"With eyes that can see in pitch-darkness, it never lets its prey escape. Some even call it “the emperor of dark nights.”"},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Noctowl never fails at catching prey in darkness. This Pokémon owes its success to its superior vision that allows it to see in minimal light, and to its soft, supple wings that make no sound in flight."},{"games":["X","HeartGold","LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"Its eyes are specially adapted. They concentrate even faint light and enable it to see in the dark."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"If it flips its head upside down, it’s a sign that it is engaged in very complex thinking."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"Its eyes are special. They can pick out objects as long as there is the tiniest amount of light."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It unfailingly catches prey in darkness. NOCTOWL owe their success to superior vision that allows them to see in minimal light, and to their supple and silent wings."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"Its extremely soft feathers make no sound in flight. It silently sneaks up on prey without being detected."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Insomnia","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's insomnia prevents it from falling asleep."},{"name":"Keen Eye","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's keen eyes prevent its accuracy from being lowered."},{"name":"Tinted Lens","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon can use “not very effective” moves to deal regular damage."}],"eggGroups":["Flying"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"forest","color":"Brown","shape":"Wings","evolution":{"id":163,"name":"Hoothoot","condition":null,"children":[{"id":164,"name":"Noctowl","condition":"Lv. 20","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,33],[1,45],[1,64],[1,143],[1,497],[9,93],[12,115],[18,403],[23,326],[28,36],[33,253],[38,355],[43,585],[48,95],[53,138]],"machine":[512,332,97,314,403,133,34,413,347,109,174,38,814,203,263,297,19,248,416,114,257,542,63,304,286,417,101,182,60,244,94,917,240,115,156,184,247,285,214,180,500,164,241,129,366,36,851,168,253,428],"egg":[297,101,48,18,17],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"sv8pt5-78","name":"Noctowl","set":"Prismatic Evolutions","date":"2025-01-17","rarity":"Rare","number":"78","artist":null,"img":"sv8pt5/78"},{"id":"sv7-115","name":"Noctowl","set":"Stellar Crown","date":"2024-09-13","rarity":"Rare","number":"115","artist":null,"img":"sv7/115"},{"id":"sv5-127","name":"Noctowl","set":"Temporal Forces","date":"2024-03-22","rarity":"Common","number":"127","artist":"toi8","img":"sv5/127"},{"id":"svp-141","name":"Noctowl","set":"Scarlet & Violet Black Star Promos","date":"2023-01-01","rarity":"Promo","number":"141","artist":"Tetsu Kayama","img":"svp/141"},{"id":"swsh10-121","name":"Noctowl","set":"Astral Radiance","date":"2022-05-27","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"121","artist":"Nisota Niso","img":"swsh10/121"},{"id":"swsh1-144","name":"Noctowl","set":"Sword & Shield","date":"2020-02-07","rarity":"Rare","number":"144","artist":"kawayoo","img":"swsh1/144"},{"id":"swshp-SWSH027","name":"Noctowl","set":"SWSH Black Star Promos","date":"2019-11-15","rarity":"Promo","number":"SWSH027","artist":"Misa Tsutsui","img":"swshp/SWSH027"},{"id":"sm11-166","name":"Noctowl","set":"Unified Minds","date":"2019-08-02","rarity":"Uncommon","number":"166","artist":"Tomokazu Komiya","img":"sm11/166"},{"id":"sm3-107","name":"Noc